                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Abandoned. Really poor basic game. \n\nA standing shooter where you \"defend\" your train against vehicles that spawn out of nowhere, but luckily have no idea how to drive, aim or target the right thing.\n\nI played for 10 minutes or so, lost zero health , got a health pickup - shot at a lot of things that spawned and didnt know what to do. Saw lots of vehicles flip by accident. etc etc.\n\nGot it as part of a bundle, but still. This is a prototype of a first attempt.\n\n1/10 Not worth the time to install it, play it and uninstall it.",
